# ===========================================================================
# ltop WinGet manifest — DISABLED TEMPLATE (not submittable as-is)
#
# Part of the 0.1.2 multi-file manifest set (version / defaultLocale /
# installer) under winget/manifests/p/pauldckim/ltop/0.1.2/. Named
